      "Veterans Student Group",
      "College of Alameda welcomes veterans to our campus community. The Veterans Resource Center (VRC) provides assistance to veterans and their dependents in their pursuit of an education at College of Alameda while utilizing veterans' and /or dependents' benefits. We are a liaison of the Veterans Administration to verify enrollment for students claiming veteran / dependent benefits."
