      "A Message from Chancellor Gilkerson",
      "Welcome to College of Alameda!",
      "College of Alameda is a special place. It's a college where people know one another, care about their students, and take pride in the community they've built. I have come to appreciate that sense of connection even more during my time serving as acting president.",
      "Our faculty, classified professionals, and administrators work hard to help students succeed. Whether you're planning to transfer to a university, preparing for a career, returning to school, or simply interested in learning something new, we want you to have a great experience here. We want you to feel welcome, find the support you need, and leave us having accomplished what you came to do."
